<title>USA: Resource Bancshares to spin off subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Resource Bancshares to spin off subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, S.C. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Resource Bancshares Corp said Tuesday it plans to spin off Republic Services Co Inc, its subsidiary specializing in electronic commerce processing.</p>
<p>The subsidiary would become an independent company in the spin-off, which is scheduled for the fourth quarter, the company said.</p>
<p>Resource said the spin-off should allow Republic Services to &quot;expand into non-traditional areas of electronic commerce, including the Internet,&quot; and better position it &quot;to pursue acquisitions or other opportunities that may arise.&quot;</p>
</text>
